<title>POLAND: Optimus Q2 net rises to PLN 8.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus Q2 net rises to PLN 8.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.66 vs	2.93</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   8.68 vs	3.77</p>
<p>    net profit				 8.12 vs	2.82</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Optimus SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 91.42 vs     79.01</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  91.99 vs     62.27</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.56 vs	1.05</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	0.11 refund</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    13.07 vs	4.00</p>
<p>    financial costs			  7.05 vs	2.05</p>
<p>    investment				 4.12 vs	3.63</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.58 vs	9.13</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  23.18 vs	8.53</p>
<p>    net profit				18.22 vs	5.54</p>
<p>    net sales				203.24 vs    188.53</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 200.61 vs    165.70</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		     na vs	  na</p>
<p>    income tax				 4.96 vs	3.10</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	0.11 refund</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    30.67 vs	3.40</p>
<p>    financial costs			 13.07 vs	2.89</p>
<p>    investment				 6.16 vs	4.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
